# Asistente + document status (roadmap)

## Por qué construimos esto

Futura Nota converge a **un solo Asistente** (la “estrella”): texto primero, voz después en tasks chicos. Los multi-agentes actuales se eliminarán. Los ajustes de producto (status ricos, schedule, etc.) preparan **señales semánticas** para que el asistente tome mejores notas — no son features aisladas.

## Schedule / reserva

Folder schedule opcional = reserva `scheduleStartAt` → `scheduleFinishAt`. Document date/time picker:

| Folder reservation | Doc status | Picker |
|---|---|---|
| No | not `reserved` | Hidden (no date / no timer) |
| No | `reserved` | Free calendar (months OK) |
| Yes | not `reserved` | Clamped to folder frame + occupied hours strikethrough |
| Yes | `reserved` | Free calendar (escape hatch outside the frame) |

Ver `timeline-product-model.mdc`.

## Document status — live subset (folders)

Campo `node.status`: `reserved` | `in_progress` | `submitted` | `past_due` | `completed` | `null`.
`completed: boolean` se deriva (`true` iff `status === "completed"`) para timeline / folder pie.
Legacy `in_review` se migra a `submitted` al hidratar.

**Visibility gate**

| Condition | Status UI on the document |
|---|---|
| Doc schedule date **outside** folder Start→Finish (or no folder/doc date) | Only **Reserved** (long-term file date aha) |
| Doc schedule date **inside** folder frame (`anchorDate ∈ [scheduleStartAt, scheduleFinishAt]`) | **All** work statuses (Reserved, In progress, Submitted, Past due, Completed) |

When a Reserved file is moved into the folder frame, every status option appears so the user can leave Reserved and start work. `reserved` remains the long-term escape hatch when the file date is outside the folder window.

| Status | Quién lo setea |
|---|---|
| *(null)* | Default al crear |
| `reserved` | Manual — plan lejos / sin urgencia; desbloquea schedule libre |
| `in_progress` | Auto al escribir body **solo si el folder tiene reserva**; también manual |
| `submitted` | Manual ahora; el asistente lo seteará al terminar un task (entrega para revisar) |
| `past_due` | Auto cuando `in_progress` + schedule del doc (dentro del frame del folder) ya pasó; también manual |
| `completed` | Manual (usuario cierra el trabajo) |

Flujo típico (folder reserved): empty → (write) in_progress → (agent) submitted → (user) completed ·· o ·· reserved → in_progress → completed.

Auto past_due: `src/lib/docPastDueTransition.js` (tick en `useScheduledAgentRunner`). No convierte `reserved` / `submitted` / `completed`.

Helper: `src/lib/docWorkStatus.js` (`sanitizeDocStatusForFolderSchedule`, `shouldShowDocStatusChip`). UI: toggle en `NodeQueryModal`; chips en `FolderDocumentRow` / `LinkedMacronodeDescription`.

## Folder status — inherited by priority

`src/lib/folderStatus.js` → `resolveFolderStatus`:

1. Cualquier child `submitted` → folder **Submitted**
2. Cualquier child `reserved` → folder **Reserved** (también: nunca mostrar Past due en el folder mientras haya reserved; persiste tras Clear del schedule del folder)
3. Cualquier child `past_due` → folder **Past due**
4. Cualquier child `in_progress` → folder **In progress**
5. Si todos `completed` → folder **Completed**
6. Else → **Not started**

Reserved bloquea Completed: 4 completed + 1 reserved → folder Reserved.

Clear / change folder schedule → reset date/time + status of non-reserved children; reserved children keep schedule + status.

## Paleta visual de referencia

Referencia Magic/badge (adaptar a dark `#151515`; SVGs `/uploads`):

| Status | Color ref | Icono | Estado |
|---|---|---|---|
| Reserved | `#EAA65D` | pending.svg | **live** |
| Past due | `#D57463` | pas-due.svg | **live** |
| Success / Completed | `#57BC6C` | Checks / completed.svg | **live** |
| In progress | `#008AF5` | CircleDashed | **live** |
| Submitted | `#9675FF` / `#6C3CF0` | submitted.svg (+ submitted-icon) | **live** |
| In review | `#F0B13D` | ScanSearch | retirado (migrado a submitted) |

Label “Submitted” (no “Submited”). Label “Past due” (no “Failed” en UI).

## Reglas

- No activar statuses “por si acaso”. Esperar brief explícito por status.
- Todo-plan ya tiene statuses propios (`TodoStatusIcon`) — no confundir con document status.
- Campaign docs siguen con active/inactive; no mezclar con work status.
